cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AEGIS: Radar Target Tracking and Interception Simulator"
abstract: >-
  A from-scratch implementation of recursive Bayesian state estimation for noisy
  radar target tracking. The project comprises a discrete-time linear Kalman
  filter with an analytically discretised white-noise-acceleration process model,
  a predictive intercept solver, a Monte-Carlo evaluation harness, and a
  real-time 3-D simulator built on a hand-written software rendering pipeline.
